{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"02530ab5a8062d7d0703da8b616e8b921976c9c2fe71edc7e09f42962438378b","ja":"給湯室のドタバタ下ごしらえ","zh":"茶水间的手忙脚乱准备工作","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"012006046f1be318a776a735b95933b662c1632c07cc0f445c4469496292d8f7","ja":"同じタコなのに、売ってる場所によって\n結構、値段に違いがあるのね。","zh":"明明是同样的章鱼，但根据售卖的地点不同，\n价格差得还挺多的呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"22b24d0d1bc2af1cb03608fe0ab57071136245c77bd65c932d5bcb5f11976b38","ja":"せやろ？　安いのでも、\nめっちゃ美味しく作るから期待しててな。","zh":"对吧？就算是便宜的食材，\n我也会做得超美味的，好好期待着吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"8c835be575a7810f372fbc43941cc1cdbf717f4ef40ddeaf3c55a9e29068aff1","ja":"はい♪　お買い物はお役に立てなかったので、\n下ごしらえは頑張りますね！","zh":"好的♪ 刚才买东西没能帮上忙，\n备料我会努力的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"e312c0a3ab6de4869f27c0844d50a03314802afce51f505f8c9627403dcf35ad","ja":"ありがとう。そんなら、星梨花はネギを切って\nもらえへん？　伊織はタコを頼むわ。","zh":"谢谢。那星梨花能帮我切一下葱吗？\n伊织，章鱼就拜托你了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"0d8981876a8829e980325ae9910cff1f836ec6f574a3d6b814e3ec9da88cc0b4","ja":"私はその間に、生地を作っとくから。","zh":"我趁这段时间先把面团做出来。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"2e548e13f6f88634efbeda00085473f19e488e448ae01c578c252fdc08115aeb","ja":"分かったわ。伊織ちゃんに任せなさい。\nこれくらい簡単に……。","zh":"我知道了。就交给伊织我吧。\n这种程度轻轻松松就……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"836d5478350b2284d41506063b52ebe1dc6ee487e797f3e6df73859f300ee4b3","ja":"って……もう！\nぬめぬめしすぎてて、切れないじゃない！","zh":"真是的……真是受够了！\n滑溜溜的，根本就切不开嘛！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"71b9e9944161ba0aec4c3dd5434d2008094bf5e296186f8e015a096a5fae90d6","ja":"そんな力任せに握らんでも……って、ああっ！？\nタコが吹っ飛んだ！？","zh":"不用使那么大劲捏啦……等等，啊啊！？\n章鱼飞出去了！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"63b7f5489573d846965b4c60d24435db497a535e136c7ccc944ac159575c3d31","ja":"きゃ～っ、頭の上に、タコが～！？","zh":"呀～！头上、有章鱼～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"270663e6a3eb6eff4f1e90659cd58233049477ca543f308003e4effefaec6d55","ja":"星梨花、落ち着いて！\nまずは包丁置いて～！","zh":"星梨花，冷静点！\n先放下菜刀～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"d759c9f9adff49d59763aa73e08690c79ecf7c7268d95a264170887cba899d64","ja":"……ふぅ。ごめんなさい。手伝うつもりが、\nまさか、こんなことになるなんて。","zh":"……呼。对不起。本想帮上忙的，\n没想到竟然会变成这样。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"83b2ec2fc4ec83b043eac25ca02fdf6b65f2ad3f384b62b94b8ba4f9a394c7d0","ja":"私もびっくりしっちゃって……\n奈緒さんの邪魔ばかりしてしまいました……。","zh":"我也吓了一跳……\n光是给奈绪添麻烦了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"9666acf35fd58af94069deae404c43c27ba6d696e0ed48b299c19e652ffd1b8c","ja":"いやいや、ふたりとも真剣やったわけやし、\nそんな気にすることないって。それに……。","zh":"不不，两个人都是认真的嘛，\n不用那么在意的啦。而且……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"09f3ddf7b13a8653cc5a3cd5448ef5fb0d26ac66c7132311528ab5a165fb81ca","ja":"それに……？\n奈緒、どうしたの？","zh":"而且……？\n奈绪，怎么了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"f227e0dcef04baab4729cb2bae77622febac0e6ac6fb23e86343131c9cf4c99f","ja":"……ふっ。あははっ！　あははははっ！\n思い出したら笑いが。タコがあんな飛ぶやなんて！","zh":"……噗。啊哈哈！啊哈哈哈哈！\n一想起来就忍不住想笑。章鱼居然能飞成那样！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"097f532cefa529a4dfcdee54a5f108e631e91e908622623e766316cce5d128d1","ja":"はぁ～……めっちゃ、笑わせてもらったわ～！\nふたりとも、最高やったで！","zh":"哈～……真是让我好好笑了一场～！\n你们两个都棒极了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"2617b76eb35c273d7b31bb4ba7acaed4ac763dff3a51f84a49549afb9b5d5908","ja":"ええっ！？　な、何よその反応。\n最高って、どこがよ？","zh":"诶！？什、什么嘛那反应。\n所谓的最棒，到底是哪儿啊？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"913c20e96f488dd0f2a6f33357ff275b0707d5432ab2f1bbe4763e0498baac01","ja":"いや、だってこんな楽しい下ごしらえ\nなかなかないで！","zh":"不过，毕竟这么有趣的备料过程\n可是很难得见到的啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"4eff1513345574936d9a3159020da386985963971facbaf7201e796cec5ce701","ja":"えっと……奈緒さんに笑ってもらえたので、\nお手伝いは成功……ということでしょうか？","zh":"那个……因为让奈绪小姐笑了，\n所以帮上忙了……应该算是成功了吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"876905b484127f09a51c5699da41b8ec3dd695c59bdac31f51ca648ecee2b7d4","ja":"もちろんや！　準備でこんなに楽しいんやから、\n本番は盛り上がること間違いなしや！","zh":"那当然啦！光是准备就已经这么开心了，\n演出当天肯定能热闹非凡的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1112.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"73e1514b49a9e30a2863009029b5cd1d23dd620d33e218e5aac851060301b075","ja":"ふたりとも、ありがとうな！","zh":"你们两个，谢谢啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
